  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Read this tree",
      "items": [
        "All 13 Applications are siblings owned by eurotransit-platform-root. Read rows in sync-wave order.",
        "Each leaf names the actual Helm chart or Kustomize source and the resources it installs. Operators and the instances they manage are separate Applications.",
        "Helm platform Applications use their declared shared and AKS value files. Marketplace uses values.yaml + values-production.yaml."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Configured AKS scope",
      "items": [
        "Keycloak Operator is installed from vendored upstream YAML, not the experimental upstream Helm chart.",
        "Kustomize composes bases and AKS patches. These are rendering sources used by Argo CD, not additional cluster services.",
        "Bootstrap installs Argo CD and repository credentials before applying the root. The tree describes declared resources, not a live-cluster inventory."
      ]
    }
  ]
